%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant T as Test runner<br/>(vitest)
    participant H as TestHarness<br/>(Probe)
    participant P as AudioPlayerProvider<br/>(state + useMemo)
    participant C as AudioPlayerContext<br/>(ctx object)
    participant E as useEffect callback

    Note over T,E: ANTI-PATTERN — useEffect([ctx]) loop OOM (lesson #14/#26/#38 nova variante)

    T->>H: render(&lt;TestHarness /&gt;)
    H->>P: useAudioPlayer()
    P->>C: ctx = useMemo(() =&gt; ({playTrack, ...}), [state])
    P-->>H: ctx (ref #1)
    H->>E: useEffect(() =&gt; ctx.playTrack(...), [ctx])
    E->>P: ctx.playTrack(...) muta state
    P->>P: setState → re-render
    P->>C: useMemo deps mudou → NOVO ctx (ref #2)
    P-->>H: ctx (ref #2)
    H->>E: deps [ctx] mudou → re-dispara effect
    E->>P: ctx.playTrack(...) muta state DE NOVO
    P->>P: setState → re-render
    P->>C: NOVO ctx (ref #3)
    Note over H,E: LOOP INFINITO<br/>heap cresce → FATAL ERROR<br/>"Reached heap limit Allocation failed"

    Note over T,E: ────────────────────────────────────────────
    Note over T,E: PATTERN A (canonico) — useRef flag + deps []

    T->>H: render(&lt;TestHarness /&gt;) [refactor]
    H->>P: useAudioPlayer()
    P-->>H: ctx (ref #1)
    H->>H: const firedRef = useRef(false)
    H->>E: useEffect(() =&gt; { if(firedRef.current) return;<br/>firedRef.current = true;<br/>ctx.playTrack(...) }, [])
    E->>E: firedRef.current === false → dispara
    E->>P: ctx.playTrack(...) muta state
    E->>E: firedRef.current = true (lock)
    P->>P: setState → re-render
    P->>C: NOVO ctx (ref #2)
    P-->>H: ctx (ref #2)
    Note over H,E: deps [] NUNCA re-dispara<br/>(re-renders nao acionam effect)
    H-->>T: render estavel — test passa

    Note over T,E: ────────────────────────────────────────────
    Note over T,E: PATTERN B (alternativo) — Imperative call em act()

    T->>H: render(&lt;Capture /&gt;) com Probe que so LE
    H->>P: useAudioPlayer()
    P-->>H: ctx (ref #1)
    H->>T: capturedCtx = ctx (assignment externo)
    Note over H,E: SEM useEffect — Probe nao muta nada
    T->>T: act(async () =&gt; { await capturedCtx.playTrack(...) })
    T->>P: mutacao controlada pelo body do teste
    P->>P: setState → re-render
    P-->>H: ctx (ref #2)
    H->>T: capturedCtx = ctx (reassignment — ponteiro atualizado)
    T->>T: expect(capturedCtx.state.status).toBe('playing')
    T-->>T: assertion pass — sem loop
